    "q-235938": {
      "dom_id": "step-q235938",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "Elena is painting her fence. There is a proportional relationship between the volume of paint $x$ (in liters) and the area \n $y$ (in square meters) she paints, as shown in the following table:\n\n| Liters of Paint $(x)$ | Square Meters $(y)$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $0.12$ | $1$ |\n| $6$ | $50$ |\n| $12$ | $100$ |\n\n \n\nWhat is the equation for the relationship between $x$ and $y?$ Write the answer in terms of the variable $x.$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "We're told that $x$ and $y$ have a proportional relationship.\n\nEvery proportional relationship can be written in the form $y=kx,$ where $k$ is the constant of proportionality.\n\nTo compute the constant of proportionality, we first need to choose a point $(x,y)$ from the table. Let's choose the point $(6,50),$ which corresponds to the second row of the table.\n\nNow, we can find the constant of proportionality as follows:\n\n$$\nk=\\frac{y}{x}=\\frac{50}{6}=\\frac{25}{3}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation is\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{25}{3}x.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
          "dom_index": 0,
          "disabled": false,
          "input_html": "<div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:45px;\n                                        margin-left:4px;\n                                        margin-right:2px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"31\"><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"33\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"35\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"34\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"36\">5</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"39\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"38\">3</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span><var mathquill-command-id=\"41\">x</var></span></div></div>",
          "rendered_text": "253​x",
          "choices_complete": false
        }
      ],
      "problem_field_keys": [
